
% Fight Song

Vr: I | vi | IV | I |
In: I |
link: I |
b: I | IV | V | vi |
b_turnaround: I | IV | V |
PCh: $b $b_turnaround
c: I | V | vi | IV |
c_turnaround: vi | V | R |
Ch: $c*2 $c_turnaround
d: vi | IV | I | V |
Vr_2: $d*2
c_turnaround_2: vi | V | IV |
Ch_2: $c*2 $c_turnaround_2
d_turnaround: vi | IV | I | V |
PostCh: vi | IV | I | V |
bridge: I | vi | IV | V |
c_final: I | V |
Ch_final: $c*2 $c_final
ending: vi | IV |
S: [G] $In $Vr $PCh $Ch $link $Vr_2 $PCh $Ch_2 $PostCh $bridge $Ch_final $ending
